  narrativeGranted: Harold Auden is a professor of gothic literature at Miskatonic
    University. A man in his mid-thirties with the face of a pubescent teenager,
    he shows up to his classes in a three-piece suit, no matter the weather. He walks
    through the halls with unmeasured steps, nearly tripping over himself. His worn
    leather satchel bounces against his hip in a desperate attempt to keep up with
    Harold. As he runs down the hallway, he suddenly comes to a full stop. Some hungover
    student puked in the middle of the hallway The janitor looks up at Harold, following
    him with his eyes as Harold presses himself against the wall to get around the
    mess
